From: "A.Cervantez" <155030226+Ywach404@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:18:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] bridge: load the metal D3D9 backend in metal mode

rt_gfx_init dlopens RT_METAL_D3D9_LIB (or libmetal_d3d9.dylib beside the
executable, or in Contents/Frameworks in a bundle), resolves the same
Direct3DCreate9 entry as DXVK and hands the library rt_log and rt_stop.
None of the Vulkan, ICD or DXVK environment is set up and none of it is
required.

The post stage 9 image check inverts for this mode: our library once,
one libSDL3, and no DXVK or Vulkan image. Direct3DCreate9 and the menu
frame line treat metal like dxvk, and the stage 9 line names the mode.
---
 shims/d3d9_bridge.c | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 84 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/shims/d3d9_bridge.c b/shims/d3d9_bridge.c
index ac30fd4..fbbe564 100644
--- a/shims/d3d9_bridge.c
+++ b/shims/d3d9_bridge.c
@@ -928,6 +928,27 @@ static void image_check(void)
                        "libvulkan_lvp %d", sdl, loader, kk, lvp);
 }
 
+/* The metal mode loads one D3D9 library of its own and no Vulkan at all, so
+   the check inverts: our library once, one libSDL3, and no DXVK, loader or
+   ICD image, since any of them would mean a second renderer in the process. */
+static void metal_image_check(void)
+{
+    int sdl = 0, ours = 0, other = 0;
+    for (uint32_t i = 0; i < _dyld_image_count(); i++) {
+        const char *n = _dyld_get_image_name(i), *b = strrchr(n, '/');
+        b = b ? b + 1 : n;
+        if (!strstr(b, "libdxvk_d3d9") && !strstr(b, "libvulkan") && !strstr(b, "libSDL3") && !strstr(b, "libmetal_d3d9"))
+            continue;
+        rt_log("gfx image %s", n);
+        sdl += !strncmp(b, "libSDL3", 7);
+        ours += !strncmp(b, "libmetal_d3d9", 13);
+        other += strstr(b, "libdxvk_d3d9") || strstr(b, "libvulkan");
+    }
+    if (sdl != 1 || ours != 1 || other)
+        rt_stop(15, 0, "gfx image check failed: libSDL3 images %d, libmetal_d3d9 %d, dxvk or Vulkan images %d", sdl, ours,
+                other);
+}
